.DS_Store

# Python virtualenvs
venv/
event-counter/venv/

# The event-counter side project (RTSP people counter). Untracked deliberately in
# fd39b416 — it carries a 6.9 MB YOLO weights file, a local SQLite database and
# __pycache__, none of which belong in the app repo. It was never re-ignored, so
# the next `git add -A` would have pulled all of it back in.
#
# NOTE: the line above this block used to read `.DS_Storeevent-counter/venv/` —
# `.DS_Store` had no trailing newline, so it fused with the following pattern and
# git saw one nonsense entry instead of two rules. Keep a newline at end of file.
event-counter/
